sequenceDiagram
    %% comments/contract.ts is the contract; store.ts writes, agent.ts answers
    actor person as Person
    participant page as Archer page
    participant service as Background service
    participant file as x.comments.json beside the diagram or note
    participant app as MCP server (application layer)
    actor agent as Coding agent
    person->>page: select elements or a note passage, press C, write
    page->>service: POST api/comments with target and anchor
    service->>file: bakery lock, read-modify-write, thread status draft
    service-)page: SSE comments
    alt queued submission (default)
        Note over person,page: edit drafts freely, then send the queued batch
        person->>page: Send queued comments (N)
        page->>service: POST api/comments/submit
        service->>file: queued batch becomes sent
    else immediate shared service setting
        service->>file: publish only the person-changed thread
        service-)page: SSE comments with final sent thread
    end
    person->>agent: I sent comments
    agent->>app: get_comments
    app->>file: sent threads become read, under the same lock
    app-->>agent: read threads with their revisions
    agent->>agent: change the diagram or note if asked
    agent->>app: reply_comment threadId, body, expectedRevision
    alt the person edited the thread since the read
        app-->>agent: thread_changed with the thread as it is now
    else revision unchanged
        app->>file: append the agent's comment, status answered
        app-->>agent: the thread
    end
    file-)service: fs.watch event, reload reconciles comments
    service-)page: SSE comments for that target
    page->>service: GET api/comments?target=view:id
    page-->>person: the agent's reply in the thread
    agent->>app: resolve_comment threadId, expectedRevision
    app->>file: status resolved, kept until dismissed
    person->>page: dismiss
    page->>service: POST api/comments/threadId/dismiss
    service->>file: thread removed, the file deleted when empty
